5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure the person who handles the money isn't too stressed. I'll look into the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree that we need a sustainable system. To avoid guesswork, I will look into last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I think it is important to understand how our members are currently integrating and if the atmosphere is changing. I will look into the taster evening forms from non-joiners and the minute books from the named-grade years.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I've noticed people seem a bit hesitant lately. I want to see why the vibe has shifted, so I'll check the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I want to see if the workload and attendance are as unbalanced as they seem. I'll check the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,Does anyone else think we should check the sign-in sheets? I'm curious if the treasurer has to spend a lot of time checking those too.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Minato, Shunichi is already handling the sign-in sheets and the rota. I believe that will provide the data you need regarding attendance patterns without duplicating effort.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree with Ryuji. We should trust Shunichi's findings on attendance. Let's focus on our chosen areas first so we can compare different perspectives on the club's health.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, don't worry too much! We'll all share what we find. I'm more interested in why people are suddenly overthinking their attendance. Let's just stick to the plan for now and see what the data says.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, I've got the sign-in sheets covered. I'll let you know if the numbers look as skewed as I suspect. Let's just proceed with our current selections.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"Okay, I understand. I'll stick with my choices then. I just want to make sure we don't make the job too hard for the next person.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"That is a valid concern. However, we must also ensure the fee is based on actual costs. I will focus on the financial records to provide that foundation.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"We should also consider how our decisions affect the newcomers. If we make the entry process too rigid, we might lose the openness that has always defined this club.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"Exactly! We can't let the paperwork kill the fun. If people feel like they're being audited just for showing up, they'll stop coming altogether. I'm really hoping the turnout data explains this.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Fun is all well and good, May, but fairness is what keeps a club from rotting. If a few people are doing all the heavy lifting, the ""vibe"" will shift regardless of the paperwork.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a way to be fair to everyone while keeping things simple. I'm looking forward to hearing what you all find out.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Minato,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let us proceed with the research and return with the facts. I believe a rational approach based on the data will lead us to the most stable solution.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let's ensure we look at these records with an eye toward maintaining the club's welcoming nature. I look forward to seeing the results.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm ready to see what's actually going on! Let's hope we find a way to make things feel easy and inviting again. See you all in the next round!

May:","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
