28,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's see if the numbers back up the complaints. I'll be interested to see if your ""vibe"" is just a symptom of a few people doing everything.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
